e next day, Sachiko goes to work, but she can't stop thinking about Shungo. She realizes she is more traumatized than she thought. Sachiko decides to go to a restaurant. When her meal comes out, she forgetsall about Shungo. Her experience makes her become a connoisseur of gourmet meals.\r\n~~Based on the manga series \"Boukyaku no Sachiko\" by Abe Jun.","rating":{"sources":[],"value":0,"age":"r"},"episode_id":10564,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}